<title>USA: JLM Industries Inc IPO lowers price range.</title>
<headline>JLM Industries Inc IPO lowers price range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The estimated price range for the planned initial public offering in JLM Industries Inc was lowered, lead underwriter Oppenheimer said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The estimated price range dropped to $10 to $12 per share from $12 to $14 a share originally. The offer maintained the proposed number of shares as 2.3 million shares. The company expects to trade under the symbol &quot;JLMI&quot; on the Nasdaq National Market on Thursday.</p>
<p>JLM Industries is a chemical distributor.</p>
